# Magnetic Particles

**Authors:** M. A. Novotny, P. A. Rikvold

## Summary
We present an overview of the subject of Magnetic Particles, starting at a level suitable for advanced high-school students and ending at a level suitable for current practitioners in the field. The sub-topics covered include: Types of Magnetic Materials, Relationships Between the Vector Fields, Magnetic Energies, Dynamics of Magnetic Particles, and Magnetocaloric Effects.


